Port of dwl-patches client-opacity-focus (2026-04-27) to dwl 0.9.
Original: https://codeberg.org/dwl/dwl-patches/src/branch/main/patches/client-opacity-focus
Changes vs upstream: rebased onto 0.9, per-frame opacity loop moved into the
simpler 0.9 rendermon, unfocus handled via focused_client, XWayland clients
given default opacity too.

